# Normalise line endings to LF on every platform.
# The synthetic data and eval datasets are SHA-256 hash-checked (data/synthetic/MANIFEST.json,
# tests/unit/test_synth.py). If Git ever rewrote them as CRLF on checkout the hashes would break,
# so force text files to LF regardless of the user's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
